            "Dynamic QR Reconciliation Fee Treatment: When an enterprise deploys an automated dynamic QR service subject to a gateway fee (for example, 0.2%), the business does not record revenue net of fees. Per Vietnamese Accounting Standards and Circular 99/2025/TT-BTC, gross sales revenue must be recognized in full on Account 511 (e.g., 10,000,000 VND), with the net deposit debited to Account 112 (9,980,000 VND) and the processing service fee recognized as an operating selling expense debited to Account 641 (20,000 VND).",
