        "desc": "When the payer and payee bank at the [[same financial institution|onus]], the core banking system simply updates two deposit liability records within its internal general ledger (the enterprise records Debit Account 331 / Credit Account 112: 20,000,000 VND under Circular 99/2025/TT-BTC, unofficial summary) — preserving 100% of the ~0.1%/year [[CASA|casa]] deposit pool."
