            "sceneIndex": 6,
            "t0": 328.99,
            "t1": 340.17,
            "text": "Examine the underlying economic exchange: in order to keep nine point five million dong in your bank account for an extra fifteen days, you paid five hundred and ninety-two thousand five hundred dong in interest."
