          {
            "index": 66,
            "sceneIndex": 8,
            "t0": 427.32,
            "t1": 436.71,
            "text": "Because you did not clear one hundred percent of the billed balance, the system cancels the entire grace period and charges the full four hundred and fifty thousand dong in retroactive interest."
          },
          {
            "index": 67,
            "sceneIndex": 8,
            "t0": 436.71,
            "t1": 447.4,
            "text": "Second: if you use a credit card to withdraw cash at an automated teller machine, that withdrawal carries zero grace period, incurring an immediate four percent cash fee plus daily interest from the second cash dispenses."
          },
          {
            "index": 68,
            "sceneIndex": 8,
            "t0": 447.4,
            "t1": 455.96,
            "text": "Third: even after you pay one hundred percent of cycle two's balance, daily interest between billing cutoff and payment date generates trailing residual interest on cycle three."
          },
          {
            "index": 69,
            "sceneIndex": 8,
            "t0": 455.96,
            "t1": 464.0,
            "text": "Unless you proactively verify and settle that final trailing residual amount, your account remains technically indebted and continues accumulating minor finance fees."
          },
          {
            "index": 70,
            "sceneIndex": 9,
            "t0": 464.0,
            "t1": 471.37,
            "text": "The minimum payment button is not a discount or a customer reward; it is an emergency life preserver designed to protect your credit record when facing an authentic cash emergency."
          },
          {
            "index": 71,
            "sceneIndex": 9,
            "t0": 471.37,
            "t1": 475.83,
            "text": "In exchange for that relief, you pay borrowing costs for the entire period the bank advanced wholesale funds."
          },
          {
            "index": 72,
            "sceneIndex": 9,
            "t0": 475.83,
            "t1": 487.46,
            "text": "The next time you see the five-hundred-thousand minimum button sitting alongside a ten-million statement balance on your screen, remember the real calculation: paying five hundred thousand today results in five hundred and ninety-two thousand five hundred dong in interest next cycle."
          },
          {
            "index": 73,
            "sceneIndex": 9,
            "t0": 487.46,
            "t1": 492.58,
            "text": "Only when you pay one hundred percent of your billed balance does the forty-five-day interest-free grace period truly return."
          },
          {
            "index": 74,
            "sceneIndex": 9,
            "t0": 492.58,
            "t1": 500.0,
            "text": "Treat the grace period as an all-or-nothing proposition: settle in full, or recognize that you are accessing one of the most expensive short-term credit lines in commercial finance."
          }
