            "index": 4,
            "sceneIndex": 0,
            "t0": 16.91,
            "t1": 29.98,
            "text": "In less than three seconds, before the barista has even finished snapping the plastic lid onto your cup, a small wireless speaker plugged into the counter chimes clearly: 'Received fifty thousand dong.' Now, compare this with the ten million dong banquet bill from Story 1."
